==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sem-}}
{{inh+|en|enm|symulat|t=feigned, similar}}, from {{der|en|la|simulātus}}, past participle of {{m|la|simulō||make like, imitate, copy, represent, feign}}, from {{m|la|similis||like}}. See {{m|en|similar}}.

===Pronunciation===
