** {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪm.jʊˌleɪt/}}
*** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-simulate.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
** {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪm.jəˌleɪt/}}
* {{q|adjective}}
** {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪm.jʊ.lɪt/}}
** {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪm.jə.lət/}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[model]], [[replicate]], duplicate the behavior, appearance or properties of.
#: {{ux|en|We will use a smoke machine to '''simulate''' the fog you will actually encounter.}}

